# The hero's right-facing jump sheet: 13 frames, shared bank.
#
# Mirror of jump_left.map in structure, not in art: none of these 13 pictures
# is byte-identical to any left-facing one, so the sheet is drawn twice rather
# than reused. Index is the play order of HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_FROM_STAND (CAVES)
# and PRISON_HERO_WALK_JUMP_RIGHT (PRISON); ascending offset order agrees.
# F07 is reached only by the from-run entry, as on the left.
CV_4D98 HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F00
CV_4DE4 HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F01
CV_4E30 HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F02
CV_4E7C HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F03
CV_4EC8 HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F04
CV_4F14 HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F05
CV_4F68 HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F06
CV_4FBC HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F07
CV_500C HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F08
CV_5058 HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F09
CV_50A8 HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F10
CV_50F8 HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F11
CV_514C HERO_JUMP_RIGHT_F12
